---
description: Mandatory Storybook stories for all components
alwaysApply: true
---

- Every component in `src/components/` MUST have a co-located `.stories.tsx`
- New components cannot be merged without a story covering all variants
- Stories use semantic theme tokens only (see `color-theming.mdc`)
- Stories must pass axe a11y checks (see `accessibility-wcag.mdc`)
- Layout/navigation stories must include RTL variant
- Use Storybook autodocs (`tags: ['autodocs']`)
- Each story file includes: `Default`, `Dark`, `RTL`
- Run `pnpm build-storybook` before opening PRs
